NAME
       apropos - search the manual pages by description

SYNOPSIS
       apropos [-s section] word ...

DESCRIPTION
       Reads the NAME line of every manual page and prints those whose
       name or description contains WORD, ignoring case. This is how to
       find a command when you know what it should do but not what it
       is called.

OPTIONS
       -s N   search only section N: 1 commands, 2 system calls,
              3 library functions

EXAMPLES
       apropos disk
       apropos -s 2 socket
       apropos colour

SEE ALSO
       man(1)
